        "name": "Crescent Cross Training",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have familiarity with the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Crescent Cross], an ingenious weapon that combines an arm-mounted, multi-chamber crossbow with a crescent-shaped blade. For the purposes of proficiency, you treat both its configurations as simple weapons.</p>\n<p>Feats and abilities from this archetype that normally work with a gauntlet bow also work with your crescent cross, treating the melee form of the crescent cross as a gauntlet where appropriate. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Crescent Spray] action.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Crossbow Infiltrator Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Battlecry!"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "definition": [
