          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You specialize in reloading while preparing for the next step in your infiltration. Interact to reload a weapon you have familiarity with from this archetype, then either Hide, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Sneak], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Take Cover].</p>"
